00_add_Pvalues.sh

Add a P column to munged sumstats based on their Z-score.

01_magma_annotate.sh

Use NCBI build 37.3 gene locations to map SNPs to genes.

02_magma_gene_analysis

Create gene scores from summary statistics and snp-gene map.

03_magma_merge

Merge all chromosomes of the above.

04_magma_geneset.sh

Get gene set enrichments from merged gene scores.

3_magma_jack.sh

Get gene set enrichmetns from merged gene scores for 200 jackknife iterations. Excluded gene blocks can be found in the data directory.

4_enrich_corr_jack.sh

Calculates Pearson enrichment correlations for the 200 jackknife iterations.

5_gene_correlations.sh

Calculates Pearson gene score correlations for the 200 jackknife iterations.

6_gene_corr_no_jk.sh

Calculates Pearson gene score correlations with no excluded genes.

7_non_jk_enrich_corr.sh

Calculates Pearson enrichment correlations with no excluded genes.

add_P.R

This script is run by 00_add_Pvalues.sh

gene_corr_no_jk.R

This script is run by 6_gene_corr_no_jk.sh.

gene_zstat_correlation.R

This script is run by 5_gene_correlations.sh.

mean_N.R

Calculates the mean sample size across all SNPs for a sumstats file. It also returns other quantities like minimum, maximum, and median.

unweighted_enrich_corr_njk.R

This script is run by 7_non_jk_enrich_corr.sh.

unweighted_enrich_corr.R

This script is run by 4_enrich_corr_jack.sh.

render_paired_figure.R

Creates figure comparing same-trait and cross-trait gene set enrichment correlations across collections. Also run as part of the SEM pipeline.
